# Do you have an API I can use?

September 27, 2025

**While we currently do not offer a public API for developers or external applications,** we do provide **[QUL: The Quranic Universal Library](https://qul.tarteel.ai/)**.

QUL is a dedicated resource hub crafted for developers, innovators, and anyone passionate about creating impactful Islamic tech projects. It provides cutting-edge tools and resources to support your journey in building solutions that serve the Ummah. Most of the resources you are seeking to consume through an API can be downloaded from QUL.

Explore QUL today to discover how it can empower your work and contribute to the future of Quranic technology: **[Explore QUL](https://qul.tarteel.ai/)**.

For additional digital Quran resources, you may also find the following platforms helpful:

- [Quran.com](https://quran.com/)

- [QuranEnc.com](https://quranenc.com/)

- [AlQuran.cloud](https://alquran.cloud/)


We look forward to seeing the incredible projects you create, insha'Allah!

